    v_quiz_id, 'single', 'If three positive numbers a, b, c are in Harmonic Progression (HP), then the middle term b is:', 'Since 1/a, 1/b, 1/c are in AP: 2/b = 1/a + 1/c = (a + c)/ac -> b = 2ac / (a + c).',
