    v_quiz_id, 'single', 'In a system of linear equations AX = B, according to Cramer''s Rule, a unique solution exists if:', 'Cramer''s rule yields x = Dx/D, y = Dy/D, z = Dz/D. A unique solution exists if and only if D != 0.',
